// Title: Nile process transforming a stream of Beziers by a matrix
// Author: not credited on the listing page
// Source: VPRI TR-2011-004 (STEPS 2011 progress report), Section 'Graphics' / Nile syntax; listing after 'Definition of a Nile process for transforming a stream of beziers by a matrix'; PDF page 12 (printed page 11).
// Transcribed from the page images; text-layer differences noted below.
type Bezier = (A:Point, B:Point, C:Point)
TransformBeziers (M:Matrix) : Bezier >> Bezier
    ∀ (A, B, C)
        >> (MA, MB, MC)

// Transcription notes
// - [?] The quantifier is read as "∀" (U+2200) from the image; the text layer agrees.
// - The text layer and the page image agree on all other lines.
// - Indentation as printed; exact space counts may differ slightly.
